["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">噴水</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふんすい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">喷泉；喷水池</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">紛争</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふんそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">纠纷；冲突；争端；骚乱；不和</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83697\"><ruby>紛争<rp>(</rp><rt>ふんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のない<ruby>人間社会<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげんしゃかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はありえない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There can be no human society without conflict.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ふんだん</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">丰富；充足；充裕；奢华</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">奮闘</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふんとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">奋力；苦战；顽强拼搏；激战；激烈战斗</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83186\"><ruby>暮<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らしのために<ruby>奮闘<rp>(</rp><rt>ふんとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She struggles for her living.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">粉末</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふんまつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">细粉；粉末</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74253\">アルミニウム、マグネシウム、シリコンなどの<ruby>粉末<rp>(</rp><rt>ふんまつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>爆発<rp>(</rp><rt>ばくはつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Powders of aluminium, magnesium, silicon, etc. explode.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">部</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">（组织、公司等的）部门；科室；局；学院；（学校、大学等的）俱乐部；社团；队；部分；区域；地区；地带；类别；种类；部分；章节；标题；（报纸、杂志、书籍等的）册；份</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91743\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はバスケット<ruby>部<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She is a member of the basketball club.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">部下</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">部下；下属；属下</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148693\"><ruby>主任<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>部下<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>意<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のままに<ruby>支配<rp>(</rp><rt>しはい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The boss controls his men at will.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ぶかぶか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">衣服过大；宽松；肥大；鼓胀；翘曲；变形；嘟嘟声；噗噗声；（喇叭等）鸣响声</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"9246478\">このズボン、ぶかぶかだよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">These trousers are too large.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">武器</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">武器；兵器；军械；武器；手段；优势</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"98190\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らはいつも<ruby>武器<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">They always bore arms with them.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">無沙汰</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶさた</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">久未写信或联系；疏于问候；久无音讯</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217016\">ご<ruby>無沙汰<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶさた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をして、ごめんなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I am sorry I did not write to you for such a long time.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ブザー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">蜂鸣器；个人报警器</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149183\"><ruby>社長<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はブザーで<ruby>秘書<rp>(</rp><rt>ひしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>呼<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The boss buzzed his secretary.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">武士</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">武士；武者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"84263\"><ruby>武士<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わねど<ruby>高楊枝<rp>(</rp><rt>たかようじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">A samurai, even when he has not eaten, uses a toothpick like a lord.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">部首</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶしゅ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">部首</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">無事</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">安全；平安；宁静；安全地；顺利地；平安无事地；身体健康；康健；无所作为；倦怠</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"119462\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>無事<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だと<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>喜<rp>(</rp><rt>よろこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">They rejoiced when they heard he was safe.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">侮辱</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶじょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">侮辱；凌辱；轻蔑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"105539\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>絶<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えず<ruby>侮辱<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶじょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>怒<rp>(</rp><rt>おこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らせた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">His constant insults aroused my anger.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">武装</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">武装；装备；持械；武装起来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96861\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>銃<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>武装<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">They armed themselves with guns.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">舞台</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶたい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">舞台；戏台；舞台演出；舞台表演；话剧；戏剧；故事背景；场景；活动领域；舞台；场所；竞技场；世界</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170536\"><ruby>最高<rp>(</rp><rt>さいこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>舞台<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The performance was excellent.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">豚肉</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶたにく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">猪肉；豚肉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220250\">この<ruby>豚肉<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶたにく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は１キロいくらですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">How much is this pork a kilo?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">斑</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">斑点；斑纹；斑驳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">部長</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶちょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">部门主管；科长；课长；（学校社团）负责人；队长</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149169\"><ruby>社長<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>部長<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>任命<rp>(</rp><rt>にんめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The president appointed a new manager.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物価</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶっか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">商品价格；物价；生活成本</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83791\"><ruby>物価<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶっか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまもなく<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がるはずだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Prices ought to come down soon.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物資</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶっし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">物资；物品；商品；资源；物料</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143129\"><ruby>政府<rp>(</rp><rt>せいふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>島<rp>(</rp><rt>しま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にヘリコプターで<ruby>物資<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶっし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>輸送<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The government transported goods to the island by helicopter.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物質</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶっしつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">物质；材料；（物理学）物质</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206886\">その<ruby>物質<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶっしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>酸<rp>(</rp><rt>さん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>処理<rp>(</rp><rt>しょり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなければならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The substance must be treated with acid.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物騒</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶっそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">危险的；不安定的；不安全的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126882\"><ruby>地震<rp>(</rp><rt>じしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>あと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、この<ruby>辺<rp>(</rp><rt>あた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りは<ruby>物騒<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶっそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">After the earthquake the neighbourhood felt insecure.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物体</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶったい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">物体；物件</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217789\">これらの<ruby>物体<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶったい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>本来<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんらい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>有害<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">These substances are not poisonous in themselves.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">打つ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">击打；打击；敲打；发表（演讲）；致（辞）；赌博；下赌注</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197169\">ぶたれて<ruby>耳鳴<rp>(</rp><rt>みみな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りがした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">My ears were ringing from being beaten.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ぶつかる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">碰撞；撞上；与...相撞；击中；遭遇；碰到；遇见；面临；陷入；遭受；（意见、人等）相冲突；矛盾；不一致；（事件）时间重合；同时发生；迎难而上；大胆面对</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121659\"><ruby>波<rp>(</rp><rt>なみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>岩<rp>(</rp><rt>いわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にぶつかってくだけている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Waves are breaking against the rocks.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物議</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶつぎ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">公开讨论；公众舆论；争议</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137764\">その<ruby>作品<rp>(</rp><rt>さくひん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>画壇<rp>(</rp><rt>がだん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>物議<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶつぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をかもした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This artwork excited much controversy in the world of art.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ぶつける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">击中；撞击；碰撞；投掷；扔向；抛向；发泄；表达；提出问题；使对抗；使相对；使比赛；使对阵</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"164345\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>泥<rp>(</rp><rt>どろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をぶつけて、<ruby>泥<rp>(</rp><rt>どろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だらけになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He threw mud at me and made me dirty.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">仏像</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶつぞう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">佛像；佛像雕像；佛教造像</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207827\">その<ruby>彫刻家<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょうこくか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>仏像<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶつぞう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>刻<rp>(</rp><rt>きざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The sculptor carved wood into an image of Buddha.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ぶつぶつ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">咕哝；抱怨；嘟囔；痘痘；疙瘩；皮疹；红疹；切成小块；咕嘟咕嘟地煮；小火慢炖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183640\"><ruby>顔<rp>(</rp><rt>かお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にぶつぶつができてる。<ruby>最近<rp>(</rp><rt>さいきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>寝不足<rp>(</rp><rt>ねぶそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だからなぁ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I&#x27;m getting little pimples on my face. I wonder if I&#x27;ve been getting enough sleep lately.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">物理</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶつり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自然规律；物理规律；物理学</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"152932\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>物理<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶつり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だけでなく<ruby>化学<rp>(</rp><rt>かがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I have a liking for chemistry as well as for physics.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ぶどう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">葡萄；葡萄树</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166220\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはぶどうをたくさん<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We got many grapes.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">無難</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶなん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">安全；稳妥；无害；温和；可以接受；还可以；令人满意；适当；无缺陷；完美无瑕</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">部品</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶひん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">零件；配件；部件</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174614\"><ruby>古<rp>(</rp><rt>ふる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>部品<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶひん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいのと<ruby>交換<rp>(</rp><rt>こうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Exchange the old part for a new one.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">部分</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶぶん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">部分；段落；片段</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198072\">パズルのここの<ruby>部分<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>仕上<rp>(</rp><rt>しあ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がらない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I can&#x27;t finish this part of the puzzle.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">部門</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぶもん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">部门；分部；分类；领域；类别；组别</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184610\"><ruby>各<rp>(</rp><rt>かく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>部門<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>優勝候補<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうしょうこうほ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The top favorites of each section were gathered together.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ブラウス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-z